          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, when it comes to Destruction",
          "next": [
            202210001
          ]
        },
        "202210001": {
          "id": 202210001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "You must be really experienced",
          "next": [
            202210002
          ]
        },
        "202210002": {
          "id": 202210002,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "next": [
            202210003
          ]
        },
        "202210003": {
          "id": 202210003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Doomsday Beast, Phantylia, Irontomb...",
          "next": [
            202210004
          ]
        },
        "202210004": {
          "id": 202210004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "I'm curious, how did you feel during your \"friendly\" encounters with them?",
          "next": [
            202210005,
            202210007,
            202210009
          ]
        },
        "202210005": {
          "id": 202210005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Fun. Just gotta stare them down, no need to lift a finger",
          "next": [
            202210006
          ]
        },
        "202210006": {
          "id": 202210006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Mhm, looks can kill after all~",
          "next": [
            202210012
          ]
        },
        "202210007": {
          "id": 202210007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Unfortunately, I feel nothing. Simply dead inside",
          "next": [
            202210008
          ]
        },
        "202210008": {
          "id": 202210008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Mhm, how impartial~",
          "next": [
            202210012
          ]
        },
        "202210009": {
          "id": 202210009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I take it step by step",
          "next": [
            202210010
          ]
        },
        "202210010": {
          "id": 202210010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Trading punches back and forth, and that's all it took",
          "next": [
            202210011
          ]
        },
        "202210011": {
          "id": 202210011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "I see, turn-based~",
          "next": [
            202210012
          ]
        },
        "202210012": {
          "id": 202210012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Destruction isn't a glorious moment... but its beauty is undoubtedly indisputable",
          "next": [
            202210013
          ]
        },
        "202210013": {
          "id": 202210013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "You will persist on this path and continue to Trailblaze onward",
          "next": [
            202210014
          ]
        },
        "202210014": {
          "id": 202210014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Until... you destroy Destruction, right?",
          "next": [
            202210015,
            202210018
          ]
        },
        "202210015": {
          "id": 202210015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wanna join us? You've already betrayed \"Destruction\" anyway",
          "next": [
            202210016
          ]
        },
        "202210016": {
          "id": 202210016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "I can't wait for that day to come",
          "next": [
            202210017
          ]
        },
        "202210017": {
          "id": 202210017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "However, if you stand against the Trailblaze",
          "next": [
            202210021
          ]
        },
        "202210018": {
          "id": 202210018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Will you return to Destruction? How is betraying twice not considered a betrayal?",
          "next": [
            202210019
          ]
        },
        "202210019": {
          "id": 202210019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "That's a great idea, I like it",
          "next": [
            202210020
          ]
        },
        "202210020": {
          "id": 202210020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "If you stand against the Trailblaze",
          "next": [
            202210021
          ]
        },
        "202210021": {
          "id": 202210021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Then step into the fireworks you ignited",
          "next": [
            202210022
          ]
        },
        "202210022": {
          "id": 202210022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "So, just as their \"script\" says",
          "next": [
            202210023
          ]
        },
        "202210023": {
          "id": 202210023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Becoming the Lord Ravager to destroy Remembrance isn't such a bad choice",
          "next": [
            202210024
          ]
        },
        "202210024": {
          "id": 202210024,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "next": [
            202210025
          ]
        },
        "202210025": {
          "id": 202210025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Get a grip!",
          "next": [
            202210026
          ]
        },
        "202210026": {
          "id": 202210026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "Love, trust, and waiting",
          "next": [
            202210027
          ]
        },
